ippo has heavily out-raised Democrat Teresa Benitez-Thompson and drawn most of the outside spending, but he has faced weeks of negative coverage, including reports he was fired as a squadron commander in 2008, carpetbagger allegations, and a skipped rural debate.\n\nPolling is thin and somewhat dated, but the two most recent surveys show a margin of one to six points toward the Republican, far tighter than the district's partisan lean would suggest. Prediction markets still favor the Republican by roughly three-to-one. The fundamentals point to a narrow Republican win, with real but limited downside risk for the party.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.213, "margin": -4.52}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2977, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2868, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2952, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2127, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2908, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.3379, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.3508, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.3896, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.3448, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.3118, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2576, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2807, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1915, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2968, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.3004, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2172, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2027, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.2837, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.2377, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.2769, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.2611, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.2188, "margin": -4.8}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.2838, "margin"